#: build-src/community/index.md:1
msgid "Community"
msgstr "Communauté"

#: build-src/community/index.md:3
msgid ""
"The NumaHOP community is principaly active on the github of NumaHop for "
"topics related to the code and the documentation. Otherwise a renater "
"mailing list also exists."
msgstr ""
"La communauté NumaHOP est active principalement sur GitHub pour le code "
"et la documentation. Sinon la mailing-liste renater existe pour les "
"autres discussions."
